      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: I did kind of write this up in haste when the projects were giving me issues. 😅 Mad judgement clouded me. Since I have now gotten everything sorted out, and I’ve had more time to think about it, I really like what the VCC offers and my opinion has changed. I’ll be using it for the future ahead. Thanks to the team for the work on the VCC and I’m excited for future updates on it!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
