  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-10-21T23:17:53.735Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I completely understand wanting a more streamlined option for deploying updates to SDK's and doing the features that VCC does. \nHowever, I feel that it should be optional, and not required that we transfer everything over. The transfer has broken my avatar projects (I have backups of everything don't worry :D) and I find it scary that I will have to transfer over next year in order to get updates. I don't want to have to redo everything in my project again, that would suck big time.",
